WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:07.173
Jigsaw Together is a relaxed puzzle for up to ten people, all working on the same picture at once.

2
00:00:07.872 --> 00:00:16.356
The host chooses a picture. Either a colourful scene made for you, or a photo of your own. Then everyone starts moving pieces.

3
00:00:16.506 --> 00:00:22.484
Drag a piece to move it. Drag the empty table to pan around, and pinch or scroll to zoom.

4
00:00:23.184 --> 00:00:29.809
Bring two matching pieces close together, let go, and they snap into place and become one bigger piece.

5
00:00:29.959 --> 00:00:33.745
If you get lost, hold the peek button to see the finished picture.

6
00:00:34.445 --> 00:00:41.264
The puzzle is done when it's all one piece. Start with the edges, split up the colours, and join the chunks together.
